IMPORTANT — THIS IS NOT AN OSI “OPEN SOURCE” LICENSE
================================================================================

True open-source licenses (MIT, Apache-2.0, GPL, AGPL, etc.) allow anyone —
including commercial vendors and governments — to run, modify, and often sell
the software free of charge.

That is intentionally NOT the arrangement for $DDD Games.

This repository is SOURCE-AVAILABLE under a STRICT dual license designed for:

  • VALIDATION & TRANSPARENCY — anyone can read, audit, play locally, verify
  • VALUE CAPTURE — commercial, SaaS, production, government use requires payment

  (A) Limited Non-Commercial Evaluation, Play & Audit License  — free, narrow
  (B) Commercial & Government Production License               — paid / written

If you need rights broader than Section A, you must obtain Section B.
There is no implied production or commercial license from GitHub visibility.

“Open source” marketing claims for this repo mean SOURCE IS PUBLIC TO READ —
not “free commercial production rights.”

